AAPL:
  thesis: >
    Example thesis — describe why you hold this stock, key catalysts,
    and revenue/earnings expectations.
  kill: "Conditions that would make you sell — e.g. revenue decline, competitive threat."
  stance: "HOLD. Add on pullback to $X."
  strategy: core_hold

MSFT:
  thesis: >
    Another example thesis with your investment rationale.
  kill: "Kill conditions here."
  stance: "HOLD. Core position."
  strategy: core_hold

XOM:
  thesis: >
    Energy sector thesis — commodity price outlook, dividend yield, etc.
  kill: "Oil below $X sustained. Dividend cut."
  stance: "ACCUMULATE on dips."
  strategy: accumulate
